<title>USA: Ict Group Q4 pro forma shr $0.03 vs $0.05.</title>
<headline>Ict Group Q4 pro forma shr $0.03 vs $0.05.</headline>
<dateline>LANGHORNE, Pa. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICT GROUP INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>Consolidated Condensed Statements of Income (Unaudited)</p>
<p>		     (In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended	 Year Ended</p>
<p>				     Dec. 31,		 Dec. 31,</p>
<p>				   1996	1995	 1996     1995</p>
<p> NET REVENUES	     $19,712   $16,037    $71,599  $52,116</p>
